# Exactly three pages on B2: Jolin (blue) -> Filter (cyan) -> Patch (amber)
# -> Jolin again. Holding B3 is no shift page (a tap re-seeds the rungler and
# leaves the page alone). B1 is the LOOP switch (B1 cyan when on).
wait 2500
expect led b2 blue
tap b2
wait 300
expect led b2 rgb 10 58 77
tap b2
wait 300
expect led b2 amber
tap b2
wait 300
expect led b2 blue
tap b2
wait 300
expect led b2 rgb 10 58 77
tap b2
wait 300
tap b2
wait 300
expect led b2 blue
press b3
wait 400
expect led b2 blue
release b3
wait 300
tap b3
wait 300
expect led b2 blue
tap b1
wait 300
expect led b1 rgb 4 30 34
tap b1
wait 300
expect led b1 blue
mark
wait 1000
expect rms > 0.05
expect finite
